AXIS Implementation Code

This folder follows the submission layout required for hash algorithms:

- Reference_Implementation: ISO C reference implementations for AXIS-512, AXIS-768, and AXIS-1024.
- Optimized_Implementation: 64-bit PC build implementations for AXIS-512, AXIS-768, and AXIS-1024.
- Additional_Implementation: reserved for future 32-bit, hardware, or other platform ports.

Each algorithm instance is placed in its own folder and includes the ICCS
CryptHash API wrapper, AXIS core implementation, DRNG support code, KAT driver,
Makefile, and README.
